WEBVTT

00:00:03.183 --> 00:00:08.150
Reports on agents' time read every state change of every agent, so they

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.085
cover 31 days at a time.

00:00:10.085 --> 00:00:14.083
Pick Last 90 Days on Agent time summary, and click Show.

00:00:14.535 --> 00:00:19.158
The report says the period is too long, and names the longest period

00:00:19.158 --> 00:00:22.406
it allows, instead of showing partial figures.

00:00:22.406 --> 00:00:25.405
Pick Last 30 Days, and the figures return.

00:00:26.989 --> 00:00:30.985
A report that measures work from a feature your site does not use

00:00:30.985 --> 00:00:34.361
shows a notice naming that feature, instead of zeroes.

00:00:34.361 --> 00:00:39.539
Here the Contact Center Call Recording feature is off, and Recording coverage says so.

